1
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:43,932
My Lady.

2
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,624
Where are you going?

3
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:49,236
I must go and do my duty.

4
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:54,190
Isn't your duty right here?

5
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:07,076
Last night, you were much bolder than this.

6
00:01:10,330 --> 00:01:11,975
You should not speak like that.

7
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:17,206
Why not?

8
00:01:18,449 --> 00:01:20,006
I am only speaking the truth.

9
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:27,009
Do I need to remind you how bold you were last night?

10
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,895
Or have you already forgotten?

11
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,990
I remember.

12
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:12,664
Then that is enough.

13
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:15,956
I was afraid you would pretend to forget.

14
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:21,538
Because I... could never forget what happened last night.

15
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:38,086
You are teasing me.

16
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:43,858
You're just realizing that?

17
00:03:45,304 --> 00:03:48,916
I've been doing this from the very beginning.

18
00:04:20,810 --> 00:04:21,446
Kaew!

19
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,658
You're here quite early this morning.

20
00:04:26,420 --> 00:04:27,243
Yes,

21
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:29,741
I came early today.

22
00:04:30,824 --> 00:04:32,820
Didn't you just come out of the Lady's room?

23
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:36,984
Kaew,

24
00:04:38,110 --> 00:04:39,396
I have something to warn you about.

25
00:04:41,810 --> 00:04:43,569
Last night, I went down by the waterfront

26
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,556
and I saw something.

27
00:04:56,135 --> 00:04:58,130
You shouldn't get that close to the young mistress again.

28
00:05:00,676 --> 00:05:04,000
Because of the difference in your social status, things can never work out between you two.

29
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:07,206
Stop this before the Lord finds out.

30
00:05:07,900 --> 00:05:09,495
I'm warning you out of goodwill.

31
00:05:15,990 --> 00:05:16,972
I understand.

32
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:37,218
The weather is lovely today, don't you think?

33
00:05:47,710 --> 00:05:48,836
Why are you stepping back?

34
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,716
I am just being careful.

35
00:05:55,735 --> 00:05:56,701
Careful of what?

36
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:05,310
Stay with me at the house tonight, Kaew.

37
00:06:07,110 --> 00:06:08,381
That is not appropriate.

38
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:12,055
What did you come across?

39
00:06:12,740 --> 00:06:13,649
Is something wrong?

40
00:06:14,812 --> 00:06:16,036
Tell me, Kaew.

41
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:27,218
My feelings are inappropriate.

42
00:06:28,990 --> 00:06:30,412
We are too different.

43
00:06:32,006 --> 00:06:36,110
You... are the child of Luang Wisanu,

44
00:06:38,950 --> 00:06:42,775
while I am just a servant.

45
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:47,550
And besides,

46
00:06:53,650 --> 00:06:54,732
you know that I am a woman.

47
00:06:56,450 --> 00:07:00,153
A love like this is impossible.

48
00:07:04,996 --> 00:07:06,486
Love makes everything possible.

49
00:07:07,470 --> 00:07:09,833
Only you are being a coward.

50
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:29,396
How would you feel if I disappeared?

51
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,033
What are you going to do?

52
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:36,190
If you don't want anything to happen to me,

53
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:39,630
Speak your true feelings.

54
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:24,147
See? You feel the same way I do.

55
00:08:25,930 --> 00:08:27,846
You just don't dare to admit it.

56
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,446
Don't come to tend to me this evening.

57
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,470
I want to be alone.

58
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,615
Deal with him.
